<body><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW234818223 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; "><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW72267336 BCX8" paraid="1373934801" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{208}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Studenten vormen natuurlijk een belangrijke partner in samenwerkingen binnen </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs. Het is nog weinig duidelijk of studenten momenteel actief op zoek gaan naar samenwerkingsactiviteiten om trans-, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">inter</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">- en multidisciplinaire </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">ervaringen op te doen.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Paragraph SCXW72267336 BCX8" paraid="1538621694" paraeid="{c680170a-19cc-4602-b4c4-c1eb61e29d03}{224}"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Docent-onderzoeker Margot </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">Ploumen</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> van de </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">Avans</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> Hogeschool, doet momenteel onderzoek naar de verwachtingen en ervaringen van studenten in</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> een multidisciplinair samenwerkingsproject. Meer over dat onderzoek lees je hier: </span></span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6" class="Hyperlink SCXW72267336 BCX8" href="https://www.avans.nl/onderzoek/projecten/detail/onderzoek-naar-multidisiciplinair-samenwerken-van-engineering-studenten" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun Underlined SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(70, 120, 134);  text-decoration-line: underline;  font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Onderzoek naar </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">multidisiciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> samenwerken van engineering studenten | </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Avans</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> Hogeschool</span></span></a><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW72267336 BCX8" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">&nbsp;</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW72267336 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="  margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;   font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></body>
